        <mxCell id="stage-08-09-scope-note" value="Stage 10 design is retained. Simulator screens, jobs and the NO_LOCK / FILE_LOCK / OPTIMISTIC strategies are not implemented yet. The shared SYNCHRONIZED booking core is used by normal checkout. MatchSeatRepository.update* methods on this page are planned for Stage 10." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=16;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
